# Tome of the Dead CONCEPT round-4 decor objects — DRAFT (same format as bigdecor.grid, per-cell attrs).
# patch_a / patch_b (round 5 redraw): plaster damage = 1-2 "exposed brick" patches per room. A
# light slab of plaster (solid ink with a few pits) on the black back wall, with a ragged HOLE in
# it through which outline bricks show (in register with WALL), a 1-px dark break round it. One ink ($07) per patch; recolourable per level (attr only).
